DESCRIPTION:Come join us in the DRA Library Atrium for a FREE NFC card!\n\n
 Everyone is welcome\, regardless of skill\, technical background\, or stud
 ent status!\n• Learn: Come learn how to program your NFC card to link to
  your socials\, resume\, or any other URL!\n• Chat: Discuss how NFC work
 s\, its real world applications\, and other nerdy topics!\n\nWe will be us
 ing NFC Tools (free version) for this event\, which is available on both 
 Android and iOS mobile devices. Feel free to get it yourself or have one o
 f us demonstrate it for you! You can find the Google Play\, APK\, and App 
 Store links here:\n• Google Play (Android): NFC Tools (https://play.goo
 gle.com/store/apps/details?id=com.wakdev.wdnfc&pcampaignid=web_share).\n
 • Official Website (Android): NFC Tools SE (https://www.wakdev.com/en/a
 pps/nfc-tools-se-android.html).\n• App Store (iOS): NFC Tools App (http
 s://apps.apple.com/ca/app/nfc-tools/id1252962749).\n\nThis event and poste
 r have been approved by the TDSA.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261123T200417Z
LOCATION:DRA Library Atrium\, Table 1
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Uses of technology: NFC █
