DESCRIPTION:Come to the Responsible AI Community Engagement Project (RAICEP
 ) event in DRA 116!\n\nThis session is titled Responsible AI in Action: Ex
 plore\, Build\, Discuss & Experience and will include a mix of discussion
  and hands-on activities around AI.\n\nParticipants will explore:• The b
 iggest benefits and opportunities associated with AI\n• What people need
  in order to trust AI\n• Key trust issues and concerns\, and how these c
 ould be addressed\n• A hands-on VR experience\n• Continued AI agent bu
 ilding and testing\n\nThere will also be FREE food provided at the event f
 or participants! \n\nFor participants looking for something more technica
 l\, there will also be an optional advanced activity for those who want t
 o go a little deeper and push their AI skills further.\n\nThis event is ho
 sted by one of the DATA club's partners: Mark Mc Kenzie!
LAST-MODIFIED:20261123T005018Z
LOCATION:DRA 116
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:RAICEP: Responsible AI in Action (Partnered)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
